1222:         "accepted %s CRIME_REV from 0xbfc05180: pc = ra" % k)
1223: #  CONTROL 8R: CHANNEL = its value, 0x100 (the prelude's ENDIANESS; a declined read answers 0).  INTSTAT 8R: its value
1224: #  SOFTINT | HARDINT, recomputed by every access's tail.  INTMASK 4W: the high half lands (ld +0x18).  TIME 8W: an ODD
1225: #  seed stays odd (every update adds a multiple of 66), and the register is even before it -- so parity says whether
